I much prefer a UI marker for [non-]restrictiveness. That unifies a lot of =
stuff, providing a way to think about {ne} in terms of {pe}, {noi} in terms=
 of {poi}, etc and reduces cmavo proliferation (refer to the Cmavo Non-Prol=
iferation Act of 2014, zo'o). And {ta'o} seems to fit.

